    // +5Ch, the alpha lane of the four-float "Color" property at +50h..+5Ch
    // (00ce93f8). Virtual +4Ch (00AA6980) writes it and then pushes it into the
    // node's material. Default 1. The RGB lanes at +50h..+58h are not modelled.
